description	"B1-series Pilot Battle Droid

Mass-produced, fragile combatants armed with a missile launcher and healing capabilities.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- E-5 Blaster Rifle (3)
- E-60R Missile Launcher (PLX) (1)

^8Attributes:
- 2 Reinforcements
- Close Combat Training (1)
- 10% less knockback given
- 10% more knockback taken
- Battery Recharge (2)
- Assemble (2)

^3Abilities:
- Fusion Cutter / Ammo Dispenser (3) ^3[Use]

The OOM pilot battle droids, distinguished by blue shoulders, had advanced programming to pilot vehicles and vessels. In order to accommodate their piloting and engineering tasks, these droids had advanced specialization programming that allowed them to easily understand the control systems of any vehicle. 
They also carried supplies such as emergency tools and ammunition dispensers."